# Operator-instance-specific, generated by setup_mediator.sh/setup_registry.sh
# --init-config - never a template to check in (see the *.example files for
# that). May contain local filesystem paths and, once configured, a real fee
# receive address.
/mediator.conf
/registry.conf

# Local TLS identities, keystores, journals, counterparty-history stores, and
# webclient account files - all either private keys or data derived from
# them. Matched broadly (not just at repo root) since setup scripts and the
# CLI/dashboard default to creating these next to wherever they're run.
certs/
*.keystore
*.keystore.journal.log
*.keystore.journal.head
*.keystore.history
webclient-accounts.tsv

# Editor/agent-local scratch, never project content.
.claude/
trace_dump.txt
securitynote.txt
docs.zip
docs (2)/
